The localized fire in the instrument store has been contained. Personnel
accountability is complete. The incident team controls access to the area;
nobody is to go back in for records or personal belongings.

The archive appliance and the recovery card kept inside its cabinet are
destroyed. Please preserve the copies already outside the room: mail,
raw recorder export, historian freeze, label transcription and the printer
reconstruction. The eight acceptance commitments were in the off-appliance
inventory, so the records team can test any recovered components locally.

The useful diagnostic freeze is 21:13:40 inclusive to 21:13:48 exclusive,
UTC. The recorder latch window is in the route sheet. Please keep local
time and acquisition UTC distinct when putting the timeline together.

This archive is for the investigation record. Recovering it is not a
prerequisite for the incident team to make the area safe.

